id: SAVE2-1
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: history_envelope_conformance
target: crates/core/tests/common/history_sample.rs
find: let envelope: H = serde_json::from_slice(bytes)?;
replace: let mut envelope: H = serde_json::from_slice(bytes)?; if envelope.snapshot.log.len() >= 2 { envelope.snapshot.log.swap(0, 1); }
expect-fail: samples_roundtrip_preserves_log_order_and_positions
expect-fail: samples_are_byte_identical_after_roundtrip
expect-fail: property_roundtrip_preserves_log_order
note: 読み込みでログの先頭の 2 件を入れ替える（PoC-6 の X-6 に当たるログの並びの誤り）
